ower/PortFinder/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"PortFinder identifies which switch, switchport, and VLAN your\nmachine is currently plugged into by listening for the discovery\npackets the switch is already broadcasting. No agent on the\nswitch, no SNMP, no login — just a passive 30-second listen on\nthe wire.\n\nSupported protocols:\n- LLDP (universal: Aruba, HP, Juniper, Extreme, Cisco, MikroTik)\n- CDP (Cisco)\n- MNDP (MikroTik RouterOS fallback)\n\nShips a desktop GUI and a headless CLI in one binary. The CLI\ntakes `portfinder capture --interface <NIC> --protocol LLDP\n[--json]`. Requires Npcap (with \"Allow non-administrators to\ncapture\" enabled) for non-administrator capture.","moniker":"portfinder","name":"PortFinder","packageUrl":"https://packetthrower.github.io/PortFinder/","publisher":"packetThrower","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/packetThrower","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/packetThrower/PortFinder/releases/tag/v4.1.4","tags":["cdp","discovery","lldp","mndp","network","networking","npcap","packet-capture","pcap","switch","vlan"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://github.com/packetThrower","releaseDate":"2026-07-15","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/packetThrower/PortFinder/releases/tag/v4.1.4","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/p/packetThrower/PortFinder/4.1.4/packetThrower.PortFinder.yaml","sha256":"22259b4637921560a67830ba70af11a3314ab94055a8b4307525d05ac336f75c"},{"path":"manifests/p/packetThrower/PortFinder/4.1.4/packetThrower.PortFinder.installer.yaml","sha256":"5ed89529ea968ffb8e96f5ad1494fbf484ffba13c54ca45c197ae7b115978879"},{"path":"manifests/p/packetThrower/PortFinder/4.1.4/packetThrower.PortFinder.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"8c0e2060c51c6b29196cabaff00fdde11ce117ec08c55f4d2443af6367254ba7"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"4.1.4"}